# The Dark Knight's fourth class node, a swing the player HOLDS instead of
# pressing: the spear becomes a dark storm for four seconds, and releasing
# throws eight shockwaves out of it.
#
# One skill, not two, and the fight decides how long to hold it. A map mob dies
# to the shockwave alone, so the hold is released at its minimum and the cast is
# almost all release; a boss never does, so it is held for all 26 pulses. That
# is Channel's own rule (see CombatSim::ChannelPulses), and it matches GMS's
# mobbing and bossing use without writing either down.
#
# The 870ms minimum is the 150ms wind-up plus the 720ms release, which fits one
# pulse. All their frames are positive, so the minimum is scaled by attack
# speed; the 140ms pulse clock is the skill's own, as a held swing's always is.
#
# GMS heals 1% of HP for each of the 26 attacks and 10% for each of the 120
# final attacks: 1,226% of HP, a full heal, on purpose. Both are stated as GMS
# states them instead of merged, so anything that ever reduces healing reduces
# the right number.
#
# Dropped: the knockback and status immunity during the wind-up, and the
# shockwave ignoring attack reflection; nothing here inflicts either.
name: "Calamitous Cyclone"
description:
  "Swings a spear so fast it creates a dark storm and devastates the area in "
  "front of you."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_DARK_KNIGHT_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_SPEAR
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_POLEARM
base_delay_ms: 870
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
max_enemies: 12
lines: 8
base {
  skill_pct: 2.64
  crit_rate: 1.00
  ied_pct: 0.50
  hp_recover_pct: 0.01
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.11 }
channel {
  pulse_interval_ms: 140
  max_pulses: 26
  finish_delay_ms: 720
  damage_taken_pct: 0.50
  finish {
    label: "Shockwave"
    lines: 15
    casts: 8
    base {
      skill_pct: 5.87
      hp_recover_pct: 0.10
    }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.23 }
  }
}
